Description: Make vendored deps OpenSSL 4.0 compatible
 Currently, rustc builds fail with OpenSSL 4.0 because its openssl-sys version
 (v0.7.111) is older than the version where OpenSSL 4.0 support was added--
 v0.7.114.
 .
 This patch bumps the required openssl-sys and curl-sys to the versions required
 to be compatible with OpenSSL 4.0, allowing the toolchain to build against
 OpenSSL 4.0.
Author: Rudi Heitbaum
Origin: other, https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/issues/155397#issuecomment-4303607073
Bug: https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/issues/155397
Last-Update: 2026-06-29
---
